      "action": "authenticate every API request using {{AUTH_PROTOCOL}} and reject unauthenticated or expired credentials with HTTP 401 before executing any business logic",
      "rationale": "Authentication at the boundary is the precondition for every other access-control decision; a single unauthenticated endpoint undermines the whole model."
